{
  "analysis": "I'm in the /workspace directory. I can see there's a raw_market_data.json file, an agents directory, and some setup files. I need to explore the structure to understand the file-based communication protocol and the skill requirements before building the market analysis pipeline.",
  "plan": "First, I'll explore the workspace structure to understand: 1) The skill_context documentation, 2) The agents directory structure, 3) The raw_market_data.json content, 4) Any existing setup or protocol documentation. This will help me understand how to implement the sub-agents properly.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -la agents/\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -la skill_context/\\n",
